    "description": "2004 年任天堂发布的双屏触控掌机，上屏显示、下屏触控，开创触摸游戏大众化，销量超 1.5 亿台，是史上最畅销的掌机。",
    "category": "game-console",
    "sources": [
      {"type": "documentation", "title": "Wikipedia: Nintendo DS", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo_DS", "license": "cc", "accessed_at": "2026-11-26"},
